{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 103,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        78.70909881591797,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.70909881591797,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.8902587890625,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "Laboratory facilities for LPAs require at least three separate rooms, one each for DNA extraction,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        84.66120147705078,
        527.1209716796875,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "pre-amplification procedures, and amplification and post-amplification procedures. To avoid",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.998649597167969,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        100.16120147705078,
        527.257080078125,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "contamination, access to molecular facilities must be restricted, a unidirectional workflow must",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.950237274169922,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.66120147705078,
        423.5924377441406,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "be implemented and stringent cleaning protocols must be established.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        131.16119384765625,
        526.9654541015625,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "Appropriate laboratory staff should be trained to conduct LPA procedures. Staff should be",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        146.66119384765625,
        526.9642333984375,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "supervised by a senior staff member with adequate training and experience in molecular",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        162.16119384765625,
        526.9973754882812,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "assays. A programme for the external quality assessment of laboratories using LPAs should",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        177.66119384765625,
        214.02389526367188,
        190.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "be developed as a priority.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        193.16119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        206.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        193.16119384765625,
        526.931396484375,
        206.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "Mechanisms for rapidly reporting LPA results to clinicians must be established, to provide",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        208.66119384765625,
        526.96435546875,
        221.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "patients with the benefit of early diagnosis. The same infrastructure used for performing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        224.16119384765625,
        334.59271240234375,
        237.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "LPAs can be used also to perform second-line LPAs.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        239.66119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        252.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        239.66119384765625,
        527.25146484375,
        252.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "LPAs are designed to detect TB and resistance to rifampicin and isoniazid in the direct testing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.958521842956543,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        255.16119384765625,
        527.0978393554688,
        268.30621337890625
      ],
      "text": "of processed sputum samples, and in the indirect testing of culture isolates of MTBC. The use",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.967452049255371,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        270.66119384765625,
        526.9454345703125,
        283.80621337890625
      ],
      "text": "of LPAs with other respiratory samples (e.g. from BAL or gastric aspiration) or extrapulmonary",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        286.16119384765625,
        524.4213256835938,
        299.30621337890625
      ],
      "text": "samples (e.g. tissue samples, CSF or other body fluids) have not been adequately evaluated.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.991246223449707,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        301.66119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        314.80621337890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        301.66119384765625,
        526.9532470703125,
        314.80621337890625
      ],
      "text": "The availability of second-line agents is critical in the event that resistance to rifampicin or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        317.16119384765625,
        231.2166290283203,
        330.30621337890625
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid, or both, is detected.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        332.6612243652344,
        78.81920623779297,
        345.8062438964844
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        332.6612243652344,
        526.9660034179688,
        345.8062438964844
      ],
      "text": "For patients with confirmed MDR/RR-TB, second-line LPAs are recommended to detect",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        348.1612243652344,
        334.14117431640625,
        361.3062438964844
      ],
      "text": "additional resistance to second-line anti-TB agents.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        376.5075378417969,
        191.30810546875,
        392.88751220703125
      ],
      "text": "Research priorities",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        403.1383972167969,
        78.81909942626953,
        416.2834167480469
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        403.1383972167969,
        526.8324584960938,
        416.2834167480469
      ],
      "text": "Development of improved understanding of the correlation between the detection of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        418.6383972167969,
        475.7538146972656,
        431.7834167480469
      ],
      "text": "resistance-conferring mutations using culture-based DST and patient outcomes.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        434.1383972167969,
        78.81909942626953,
        447.2834167480469
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        434.1383972167969,
        524.5894165039062,
        447.2834167480469
      ],
      "text": "Review of evidence to confirm or revise different critical concentrations used in culture-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        449.6383972167969,
        184.86380004882812,
        462.7834167480469
      ],
      "text": "based DST methods.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        465.1383972167969,
        78.81920623779297,
        478.2834167480469
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        465.1383972167969,
        461.7060546875,
        478.2834167480469
      ],
      "text": "Determination of the limit of detection for LPA in detecting heteroresistance.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.6383972167969,
        78.81909942626953,
        493.7834167480469
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        480.6383972167969,
        524.4220581054688,
        493.7834167480469
      ],
      "text": "Determination of needs for training, assessing competency and ensuring quality assurance.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.991146087646484,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        496.1383972167969,
        78.81909942626953,
        509.2834167480469
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        496.1383972167969,
        527.0009765625,
        509.2834167480469
      ],
      "text": "Gathering of more evidence on the impact on mortality of initiating appropriate treatment",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.999500274658203,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        511.638427734375,
        144.28541564941406,
        524.783447265625
      ],
      "text": "for MDR-TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        527.138427734375,
        78.81909942626953,
        540.283447265625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        527.138427734375,
        324.2088928222656,
        540.283447265625
      ],
      "text": "Meeting the STARD for future diagnostic studies.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        542.638427734375,
        78.81909942626953,
        555.783447265625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        542.638427734375,
        526.9632568359375,
        555.783447265625
      ],
      "text": "Performance of country-specific cost–effectiveness and cost–benefit analyses of LPA use in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        558.138427734375,
        244.0644989013672,
        571.283447265625
      ],
      "text": "different programmatic settings.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        586.4845581054688,
        217.8031005859375,
        602.8645629882812
      ],
      "text": "2.4.3 Second-line LPAs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        613.1156005859375,
        526.9810791015625,
        626.2606201171875
      ],
      "text": "Genotypic (molecular) methods have considerable advantages for scaling up programmatic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        628.6156005859375,
        526.8218383789062,
        641.7606201171875
      ],
      "text": "management and surveillance of DR-TB, offering rapid diagnosis, standardized testing, potential",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        644.1156005859375,
        526.7490844726562,
        657.2606201171875
      ],
      "text": "for high throughput and fewer requirements for laboratory biosafety. Molecular tests for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        659.6156005859375,
        526.9029541015625,
        672.7606201171875
      ],
      "text": "detecting drug resistance – for example, the GenoType MTBDR  assay (Hain Lifescience, Nehren,  sl",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.1156005859375,
        526.9783325195312,
        688.2606201171875
      ],
      "text": "Germany), hereafter referred to as MTBDR  – have shown promise for the diagnosis of  sl (10)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        690.6156005859375,
        526.8743896484375,
        703.7606201171875
      ],
      "text": "DR-TB. These tests are rapid (can be performed in a single working day) and detect the presence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.956413269042969,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        706.1156005859375,
        526.9547119140625,
        719.2606201171875
      ],
      "text": "of mutations associated with drug resistance. MTBDR belongs to a category of molecular  sl",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.6156005859375,
        298.67608642578125,
        734.7606201171875
      ],
      "text": "genetic tests called second-line LPAs (SL-LPAs).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 87",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}